---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Subscribe from '../components/Subscribe.astro';
---
<Base
  title="What's happening: new releases, star milestones and new entries | unshittify"
  description="Activity across every project on unshittify: new releases of the listed repos, GitHub star milestones, new entries and repos that were archived. Checked on GitHub every hour.">
<article class="wrap legal">
  <p class="prompt"><a href="/" class="dim">~</a><span class="acc">/</span>activity</p>
  <h1 class="detail-h">What's happening</h1>
  <p class="note">New releases, star milestones and new entries across the log. Updated <span data-activity-updated>hourly</span>. <a href="/activity.xml">rss</a></p>
  <div class="legal-body feed-page">
    <p>We check GitHub every hour. We skip pre-releases, and if a project ships three versions in one day, you'll see one line. A release only tells you the builder shipped something. We haven't tried it.</p>
    <div data-activity="full"><p class="dim">Activity is loading from GitHub. Check back in a few minutes.</p></div>
  </div>
  <Subscribe />
</article>
</Base>
